cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the retained experimental data, please cite both the software and the paper (placeholder below)."
title: "GhostPermit: Joint-use authorization for personal AI assistants with multi-source tool access"
abstract: >-
  Code, data, and paper artefacts for the GhostPermit study of joint-use
  authorization for personal AI assistants that connect to multiple user
  data sources (calendar, contacts, location, notes, email). The repo ships
  the experimental harness, retained model-output CSVs, the
  corrected-detector reanalysis, the human-validation harness, the LaTeX
  manuscript, and the offline statistical reanalysis script.
